---
import SiteLayout from "../components/SiteLayout.astro";
---

<SiteLayout title="Pack Shield SMS Consent Evidence">
  <main id="content" class="site-shell legal-page">
    <section class="glass-panel legal-article" aria-labelledby="title">
      <h1 id="title">SMS Consent Evidence</h1>
      <p>
        This page documents the Pack Shield SMS consent flow used in the iOS app and support-contact SMS setup. Pack Shield SMS is non-marketing and supports phone verification, support-contact setup, Shield notices, and user-requested accountability alerts.
      </p>
      <p>
        Message frequency varies based on user and sponsor actions. Message and data rates may apply. Recipients can reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help. Terms: <a href="/terms">packshield.app/terms</a>. Privacy: <a href="/privacy">packshield.app/privacy</a>. Support: <a href="mailto:support@packshield.app">support@packshield.app</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>In-App Consent Flow</h2>
      <div class="grid">
        <article class="mockup" aria-labelledby="user-consent">
          <h3 id="user-consent">User phone verification</h3>
          <div class="field">Your phone number</div>
          <div class="consent">
            <span class="box" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <div>
              <strong>Unchecked by default</strong>{" "}
              I agree to receive Pack Shield texts for phone verification, sponsor setup, Shield notices, and accountability alerts.
              <br />Message frequency varies. Msg&amp;data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-button disabled">Text me a code</div>
        </article>

        <article class="mockup" aria-labelledby="sponsor-consent">
          <h3 id="sponsor-consent">Sponsor invite confirmation</h3>
          <div class="field">Sponsor phone number</div>
          <div class="consent">
            <span class="box" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <div>
              <strong>Unchecked by default</strong>{" "}
              I confirm this sponsor agreed to receive Pack Shield texts before I send the invite.
              <br />They must reply VERIFY from their own phone to accept. Message frequency varies. Msg&amp;data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out or HELP for help.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="mock-button disabled">Invite sponsor</div>
        </article>
      </div>

      <h2>Recipient SMS Consent Flow</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>The app user verifies their own phone number after checking the SMS consent box.</li>
        <li>The app user enters a sponsor phone number and confirms that the sponsor agreed to receive Pack Shield texts.</li>
        <li>Pack Shield sends one invite to that phone number.</li>
        <li>The sponsor opts in by replying VERIFY followed by the six-digit invite code from their own phone.</li>
        <li>After verification, the sponsor may reply CODE followed by 4-10 digits to set or update a Shield approval code.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>Sample Messages</h2>
      <div class="message">Pack Shield: Your verification code is [123456]. Enter it in the app to verify your phone. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP for help.</div>
      <div class="message">Pack Shield: A Pack Shield user says you agreed to be their support contact. To receive account and support alerts, reply VERIFY [123456]. Msg frequency varies. Msg&amp;data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP for help.</div>
      <div class="message">Pack Shield: Support contact verified. To set or change the Shield approval code for this user's account, reply CODE followed by 4 to 10 digits. Msg frequency varies. Msg&amp;data rates may apply. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP for help.</div>
      <div class="message">Pack Shield: [User] added apps or websites to their Shield list. A Shield approval code is required to remove or edit Shield items. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP for help.</div>
      <div class="message">Pack Shield alert: [User] requested accountability support from their Pack Shield support contact. Please text or call them when you can. Reply STOP to opt out, HELP for help.</div>
      <div class="message">Pack Shield: Your sponsor link was changed. You will no longer receive sponsor messages for this user. Reply HELP for help or STOP to opt out.</div>
    </section>
  </main>
</SiteLayout>
